      "notes": "Lowers kp from 5.0 to 3.0 and raises kd from 0.1 to 0.3, changing only the gains. The baseline left the line on every trial (max_error about 0.06, line loss at start), which points to over-steering. Geometry and speed are unchanged so the race isolates the gain effect."
